{
  "id": "6af1d30e7dd2000610208420",
  "title": "災害対策、進まないがち",
  "created": 1794233103,
  "updated": 1794243834,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "6af1d30e7dd2000610208420",
      "text": "災害対策、進まないがち",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794233103,
      "updated": 1794243834
    },
    {
      "id": "6af1d30f0000000000246f31",
      "text": "from [2024/01/02]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794233103,
      "updated": 1794233103
    },
    {
      "id": "6af1d30f0000000000246f32",
      "text": "[inajob.icon][防災グッズ]あまり用意できていないんだよなぁ",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794233103,
      "updated": 1794233178
    },
    {
      "id": "6af1d30f0000000000246f33",
      "text": "\t我が家は5Fなので[洪水]などはあまり想定していない",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794233103,
      "updated": 1794233103
    },
    {
      "id": "6af1d30f0000000000246f34",
      "text": "\t 最近の水害は[垂直避難]して犠牲になった人が多く、垂直避難の限界が指摘されているけど、まあ5Fまで水が来ることはまずないでしょう[takker.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794233103,
      "updated": 1794233103
    },
    {
      "id": "6af1d30f0000000000246f35",
      "text": "\t [土石流]は要注意",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794233103,
      "updated": 1794233103
    },
    {
      "id": "6af1d30f0000000000246f36",
      "text": "\t 　[熱海土石流]を見れば分かる通り、ビルなんて簡単に流される",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794233103,
      "updated": 1794233103
    },
    {
      "id": "6af1d30f0000000000246f37",
      "text": "\t 　立地が[扇状地]や[谷地]の場合は注意してください",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794233103,
      "updated": 1794233103
    },
    {
      "id": "6af1d30f0000000000246f38",
      "text": "\t 　平野です[inajob.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794233103,
      "updated": 1794233103
    },
    {
      "id": "6af1d30f0000000000246f39",
      "text": "\t 　よかた[takker.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794233103,
      "updated": 1794233103
    },
    {
      "id": "6af1d30f0000000000246f3a",
      "text": "\t逃げるとしたら[火事]とか[地震]とか？",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794233103,
      "updated": 1794233103
    },
    {
      "id": "6af1d30f0000000000246f3b",
      "text": "\t\t我が家だけ火事とかなら、そこまで防災グッズは大切ではなさそう？",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794233103,
      "updated": 1794233103
    },
    {
      "id": "6af1d30f0000000000246f3c",
      "text": "\t\t 金で解決できるケースが多そう",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794233103,
      "updated": 1794233103
    },
    {
      "id": "6af1d30f0000000000246f3d",
      "text": "\t\t地震＋火事のケースは防災グッズが欲しい",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794233103,
      "updated": 1794233103
    },
    {
      "id": "6af1d30f0000000000246f3e",
      "text": "\t[いらない理由探しは不毛な気がする]ので、さっさと用意したい",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794233103,
      "updated": 1794233103
    },
    {
      "id": "6af1d30f0000000000246f3f",
      "text": "\t地震や洪水によって、電気・水道が使えなくなる可能性があるため、最低三日間はマンション内で生活できるような備えはしておいた方がいいような気がしている[biwa.icon][takker.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794233103,
      "updated": 1794233103
    },
    {
      "id": "6af1d30f0000000000246f40",
      "text": "\t 冬だと[防寒]も必要になる",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794233103,
      "updated": 1794233103
    },
    {
      "id": "6af1d30f0000000000246f41",
      "text": "\t 暮らしてるので備蓄はある[inajob.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794233103,
      "updated": 1794233103
    },
    {
      "id": "6af1d30f0000000000246f42",
      "text": "\t  持ち出し袋的なのがない",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794233103,
      "updated": 1794233103
    },
    {
      "id": "6af1d30f0000000000246f43",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794233103,
      "updated": 1794233103
    },
    {
      "id": "6af1d3530000000000246f44",
      "text": "[biwa.icon][災害発生時の避難プロトコル]を作らなきゃなー",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794233171,
      "updated": 1794233544
    },
    {
      "id": "6af1d3540000000000246f47",
      "text": " [防災グッズ]の確認もしなきゃ",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794233172,
      "updated": 1794233172
    },
    {
      "id": "6af1d3cf0000000000246f51",
      "text": " 出先で被災したら大変だよなー",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794233295,
      "updated": 1794233295
    },
    {
      "id": "6af1d3d00000000000246f52",
      "text": "  [ホイッスル]とか携帯しておくべきかもねー",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794233295,
      "updated": 1794233534
    },
    {
      "id": "6af1d3540000000000246f45",
      "text": "\tマンションに住んでるけれど、マンションの外に避難するべき時ってあまりなさそうだ",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794233171,
      "updated": 1794233288
    },
    {
      "id": "6af1d3c90000000000246f48",
      "text": "  火災、倒壊、漏水、テロ・ミサイル攻撃",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794233288,
      "updated": 1794233537
    },
    {
      "id": "6af1d3c90000000000246f49",
      "text": "  非常用持ち出し袋が必要になるのは、テロ・ミサイル攻撃の場合くらいになりそう",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794233288,
      "updated": 1794233537
    },
    {
      "id": "6af1d3c90000000000246f4a",
      "text": "   全く可能性がないわけではないので、やはり持っておいた方が良いのでは",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794233288,
      "updated": 1794233537
    },
    {
      "id": "6af1d3c90000000000246f4b",
      "text": "   だよね[inajob.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794233288,
      "updated": 1794233537
    },
    {
      "id": "6af1d3c90000000000246f4c",
      "text": "   いや、冬に停電[断水]したら...でも[避難所]の方が寒いか？[nishio.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794233288,
      "updated": 1794233537
    },
    {
      "id": "6af1d3c90000000000246f4d",
      "text": "   \t窓が割れたらやばいね",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794233288,
      "updated": 1794233537
    },
    {
      "id": "6af1d3c90000000000246f4e",
      "text": "   \tケースバイケースなので家を出る選択肢を用意しておく",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794233288,
      "updated": 1794233537
    },
    {
      "id": "6af1d3c90000000000246f4f",
      "text": "   避難所のリソースには限りがあるから、必要ない(家の倒壊や津波の危険性)限りは使用しない方が社会的には良さそうなんだよな[biwa.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794233288,
      "updated": 1794233537
    },
    {
      "id": "6af1d3c90000000000246f50",
      "text": "  [長周期地震動]の場合はやばそう[takker.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794233288,
      "updated": 1794233537
    },
    {
      "id": "6af1d4030000000000246f53",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794233347,
      "updated": 1794233347
    },
    {
      "id": "6af1d4030000000000246f54",
      "text": "[Summer498.icon]新年早々地震があったようですが皆さん無事ですか",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794233347,
      "updated": 1794233507
    },
    {
      "id": "6af1d4a000000000003032e8",
      "text": " (無事じゃない人は井戸端に来ている場合じゃない)",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794233503,
      "updated": 1794233509
    },
    {
      "id": "6af1d4a000000000003032e9",
      "text": " \t非同期コミュニケーションだとこなくなった人を見つけにくいね[nishio.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794233503,
      "updated": 1794233509
    },
    {
      "id": "6af1d4a000000000003032ea",
      "text": " \t[同期コミュニケーション]の利点[takker.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794233503,
      "updated": 1794233509
    },
    {
      "id": "6af1d4a000000000003032eb",
      "text": " \t無事です[cFQ2f7LRuLYP.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794233503,
      "updated": 1794233509
    },
    {
      "id": "6af1d49c00000000003032e6",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794233500,
      "updated": 1794233500
    },
    {
      "id": "6af1d4da00000000003032ec",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794233562,
      "updated": 1794233562
    },
    {
      "id": "6af1d4db00000000003032ed",
      "text": "この日は、前日の[令和6年能登半島地震]の余震で5回の揺れがあった",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794233562,
      "updated": 1794233863
    },
    {
      "id": "6af1d60900000000003032f0",
      "text": " [https://www.data.jma.go.jp/eqev/data/mech/cmt/cmt202401.html#:~:text=詳細-,2024-01-02%2004%3A27%3A14.4,詳細,-2024-01-03]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794233864,
      "updated": 1794233915
    },
    {
      "id": "6af1d52700000000003032ee",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794233638,
      "updated": 1794233638
    }
  ]
}